// HexTactics prototype map, stage 1.
// Format: see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md ("Формат карты").
// 12 columns x 10 rows, pointy-top hexes, odd-r offset (odd rows are shifted right by half a hex).
// Tokens: .  walkable    #  blocked    B  player base    1..9  spawn zone id (must lie on the map edge)
@name Прототип 12×10
@size 12 10
@base База игрока
@zone 1 Северный край
@zone 2 Восточный край

. . . . . . . 1 1 1 . .
 . . . . . . . . . . . .
. . . . # . . . # # . .
 . . . . # . . # . # . .
B B . . # . . . # # . 2
 B B . . # . . . . . . 2
B . . . # . . . . . . 2
 . . . . . . . . . . . .
. . . . . . . # # . . .
 . . . . . . . . . . . .
